     1413        SaldoSum AT ROW 16.47 COL 76.1 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1414        TotalPay AT ROW 16.67 COL 38.5 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1415        Mustpay AT ROW 17.77 COL 76.1 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1416        CreditSum AT ROW 17.93 COL 38.4 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1417        RestLimit AT ROW 18.93 COL 76.1 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1418        LimitSum AT ROW 18.97 COL 38.4 RIGHT-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
